# <type>(<scope>): STACKRYZE-<id> <subject>   (<= 100 chars, imperative, lowercase, no period)
#
# <body: what & why, wrapped at 100 cols>
#
# BREAKING CHANGE: <describe the break, if any>
#
# The STACKRYZE-<id> is taken from the branch name and auto-inserted for `git commit -m`.
# Allowed types:
#   feat fix hotfix chore docs refactor perf test ci build style revert
# Examples:
#   feat(auth): STACKRYZE-20 add stackryze-auth token guard
#   fix(links): STACKRYZE-41 stop expiring links from 404-ing before their TTL
